{"team":"SF","col":"#E8506A","identity":"run-heavy","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":60.9,"adot":8.0,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>A Ground-First Machine</h2><p>Their backs are a real part of the passing game \u2014 RBs see <strong>25%</strong> of targets (vs ~18%), which props up <strong>Christian McCaffrey</strong>'s reception floor.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>They're a heavy under-center team (57% shotgun vs ~68%) \u2014 a pro-style, run-committed structure.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 58% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's an efficient unit \u2014 a 47% success rate (above the 44% average).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>run-first</strong> (50% pass), funnelling touchdown equity to <strong>Christian McCaffrey</strong>.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They lock down opposing WR1s \u2014 just 51 rec yds/game (vs ~58); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They lock down opposing WR2s \u2014 just 30 rec yds/game (vs ~36); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.67/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They surrender <strong>119 rushing</strong> and <strong>219 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>Broadly a leaky unit \u2014 47% success rate allowed (vs ~44%); points come easy against them.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.31/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: back <strong>Christian McCaffrey</strong>'s rushing volume in favored/positive scripts; their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Brock Purdy","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Comp":21.56,"Att":32.3,"Pass Yds":271.58,"Pass TD":1.89,"INT":0.71,"Rush Yds":18.97}}],"RB":[{"name":"Christian McCaffrey","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":51,"props":{"Rush Att":16.22,"Rush Yds":74.32,"Tgt":6.55,"Rec":5.41,"Rec Yds":46.52}},{"name":"Kaelon Black","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":18,"props":{"Rush Att":4.15,"Rush Yds":18.34,"Tgt":1.15,"Rec":0.78,"Rec Yds":5.51}},{"name":"Jordan James","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":17,"props":{"Rush Att":4.4,"Rush Yds":19.38,"Tgt":2.0,"Rec":1.35,"Rec Yds":10.16}},{"name":"Sincere McCormick","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":21,"props":{"Rush Att":11.82,"Rush Yds":54.06,"Tgt":2.63,"Rec":2.1,"Rec Yds":14.17}}],"WR":[{"name":"Mike Evans","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":34,"props":{"Tgt":6.39,"Rec":4.0,"Rec Yds":56.49,"Rec TD":0.42}},{"name":"Deebo Samuel Sr.","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":5.81,"Rec":3.79,"Rec Yds":51.39,"Rec TD":0.22}},{"name":"De'Zhaun Stribling","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":3.54,"Rec":1.94,"Rec Yds":24.01,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Demarcus Robinson","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":18,"props":{"Tgt":3.73,"Rec":1.95,"Rec Yds":24.55,"Rec TD":0.2}},{"name":"Jordan Watkins","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.13,"Rec":1.17,"Rec Yds":14.28,"Rec TD":0.08}}],"TE":[{"name":"George Kittle","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":35,"props":{"Tgt":6.12,"Rec":4.67,"Rec Yds":61.81,"Rec TD":0.45}},{"name":"Jake Tonges","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":23,"props":{"Tgt":4.12,"Rec":2.53,"Rec Yds":23.74,"Rec TD":0.25}},{"name":"Luke Farrell","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.37,"Rec":1.5,"Rec Yds":13.22,"Rec TD":0.08}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"@","opp":"LA","opp_col":"#c9d5e0","gid":"2026_01_SF_LA","spread":"+3.0","proj":"23\u201326","win":false},{"week":2,"ha":"vs","opp":"MIA","opp_col":"#